ike"],"phrases":[["En mi familia somos…","There are … of us in my family"],["Mi hermana se llama…","My sister's name is…"],["Tiene … años.","She's … years old."],["Es médico / estudiante.","He's a doctor / student."],["Le gusta…","He / she likes…"]],"model":"En mi familia somos cuatro. Mi madre se llama Rosa y tiene cincuenta años. Es profesora. Mi hermano se llama Luis, tiene veinte años y le gusta el fútbol.","modelEn":"There are four of us in my family. My mother's name is Rosa and she's fifty. She's a teacher. My brother's name is Luis, he's twenty and he likes football."},{"id":"w3","title":"Your day","task":"Describe a normal day.","include":["what time you get up","what you eat for breakfast","how you get to work or class","what you do in the evening","what time you go to bed"],"phrases":[["Me levanto a las…","I get up at…"],["Desayuno…","For breakfast I have…"],["Voy al trabajo en metro / en carro.","I go to work by subway / by car."],["En la noche…","In the evening…"],["Me acuesto a las…","I go to bed at…"]],"model":"Me levanto a las siete. Desayuno café y pan. Voy al trabajo en metro. En la noche cocino y leo un libro. Me acuesto a las once.","modelEn":"I get up at seven. For breakfast I have coffee and bread. I go to work by subway. In the evening I cook and read a book. I go to bed at eleven."},{"id":"w4","title":"Invite a friend","task":"Invite a friend to do something this weekend.","include":["a greeting","what you want to do","the day and time","where to meet","ask if they want to come"],"phrases":[["¿Quieres ir al cine / a la playa?","Do you want to go to the movies / the beach?"],["El sábado a las…","On Saturday at…"],["Podemos comer en…","We can eat at…"],["Nos vemos en…","Let's meet at…"],["¡Hasta pronto!","See you soon!"]],"model":"Hola, Ana. ¿Quieres ir al parque el sábado? Podemos comer allí. Nos vemos a las once en la estación de metro. ¿Quieres venir? ¡Hasta pronto!","modelEn":"Hi, Ana. Do you want to go to the park on Saturday? We can eat t